WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
Your business has so much to offer.

2
00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:04.960
Make it clear—and visible in every detail.

3
00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:06.640
Imagine Vuelta 27:

4
00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:10.100
a bike workshop taking its
expertise beyond the counter.

5
00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:13.800
With Don Ventas, it starts with what
it does and needs to communicate.

6
00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:15.350
We shape the message.

7
00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:17.100
The owner reviews and decides.

8
00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:19.800
A group needs their bikes
checked before a ride?

9
00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:22.900
First, we understand their situation
and research what's needed.

10
00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:24.940
Then we prepare a presentation

11
00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:26.940
explaining how the workshop can help.

12
00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:29.040
That clarity carries through to its site,

13
00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:32.100
built with Don Ventas or
an expert of its choice.

14
00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:35.200
And to its sign, service card
and branded merchandise.

15
00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:38.400
One brand. Every piece
designed for its purpose.

16
00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:41.800
We design, deliver or
coordinate to suit the project.

17
00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:43.260
As the business changes,

18
00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:45.800
we update what's needed
without starting over.

19
00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:48.300
We're building the Don Ventas Portal.

20
00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:49.800
Join the waitlist.

21
00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:52.220
Expert services are agreed separately.

22
00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:54.040
Your brand has more to do.
